---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title="Department of Computer Science & Engineering | SRKR Engineering College" description="Department of Computer Science & Engineering at SRKR Engineering College, Bhimavaram ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â‚¬Â established 1991, NBA accredited, JNTUK Research Centre." />
  </head>
  <body>
    <SrkrHeader />

    <!-- BREADCRUMB -->
    <section class="rts-breadcrumb breadcrumb-height breadcumb-bg" style="background-image: url(/assets/images/faculty/cse/csehome.jpeg);">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-12">
            <div class="breadcrumb-content">
              <ul class="breadcrumb">
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/departments">Departments</a></li>
              </ul>
              <h1 class="section-title">Department of Computer Science & Engineering</h1>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <!-- BREADCRUMB AREA END -->

    <!-- content -->
    <div class="rts-faculty-details py-5">
      <div class="container">

        <DeptNav dept="cse" current="Home" />

        <!-- About the Department -->
        <div class="row align-items-center justify-content-md-center mb-5 pb-5">
          <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-11">
            <div class="faculty-content-text me-5">
              <h3 class="rts-section-title mb-5">About the Department</h3>

              
              <p style="text-align: justify;">Established in 1991, the Department of Computer Science and Engineering has grown from an initial intake of 40 students into a premier academic and research hub with a current B.Tech (CSE) intake of 300. Recognized as a Research Centre by JNTU Kakinada since 2019, the department also offers an M.Tech program in Computer Science and Technology. Supported by experienced faculty, specialized laboratories, E-classrooms, and ICT-enabled infrastructure, the department provides a dynamic and student-centric learning environment.</p>
              <p style="text-align: justify;">The curriculum is aligned with global technological trends and AICTE guidelines, offering specializations in AI/ML and IoT, along with Honors and Minor programs. Strong industry collaborations with organizations such as TCS iON, Netenrich, and Bennett University enhance practical exposure and employability. The department consistently achieves excellent placement records with top salary packages. Professional bodies like ISTE and the Association of Computer Engineers (ACE) further promote technical, co-curricular, and leadership excellence among students.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-11">
            <div class="ratio ratio-16x9 mt-5 mt-lg-0">
              <iframe
                src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/zWHp1cRW8fc?html5=1&enablejsapi=1"
                title="SRKR Department Video"
                loading="lazy"
                allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
                allowfullscreen
              ></iframe>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Message from HoD -->
        <div class="row mt--30">
          <div class="rts-section mb--60">
            <h3 class="rts-section-title">Message from Head of Department</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-8">
            <div class="faculty-image text-center">
              {/* TODO: replace with real faculty photo */}
              <img class="img-fluid mw-100" src="/assets/images/faculty/cse/222.jpg" alt="Dr. Bh. V. S. Rama Krishnam Raju">
              <div class="h5 mb-2 mt-5">Dr. Bh. V. S. Rama Krishnam Raju</div>
              <span>Professor &amp; Head of Department</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-8">
            <div class="faculty-content-text ms-lg-5 mt-5 mt-lg-0">
              
              <p class="h6 mb-4">Welcome to the Department of Computer Science &amp; Engineering</p>
              <p style="text-align: justify;">The Department of Computer Science &amp; Engineering at SRKR Engineering College is a leading centre for computer science education in Andhra Pradesh. With strong academic foundations in programming, algorithms, databases, networks, and software engineering, the department also focuses on emerging technologies such as AI, Machine Learning, Data Science, Cyber Security, Cloud Computing, and IoT. Supported by advanced laboratories, research facilities, internships, and industry collaborations, the department promotes innovation, research, and skill development, preparing students to become competent, ethical, and industry-ready professionals.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="border-top my-60"></div>

          <!-- Mission & Vision -->
          <div class="row g-4 align-items-start justify-content-md-center">
            <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 rts-scholarship-description">
              <div class="faculty-content-text si__list h-100">
                <h4 class="font-32 mb-3 mt-4">Vision</h4>
                <ul class="list-unstyled one-column-list mb-0">
                  <li class="mb-3">To envision a diverse, stimulating, continually improving academic and research environment to fulfil the needs of the society.</li>
                  <li>To mould students as socially responsible and competent professionals in the field of Computer Science &amp; Engineering.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 rts-scholarship-description">
              <div class="faculty-content-text si__list h-100">
                <h4 class="font-32 mb-4">Mission</h4>
                <ul class="list-unstyled one-column-list">
                  <li class="mb-3">To provide a strong theoretical and practical background across the computer science and engineering discipline with an emphasis on software development.</li>
                  <li class="mb-3">To impart modern technologies with industrial, academic and research collaboration.</li>
                  <li class="mb-3">To inculcate professional behaviour, strong ethical values, leadership abilities and impart the skills necessary to continue education for professional growth.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

